        "reference": "2 Kings 5:20",
        "book": "2 Kings",
        "chapter": 5,
        "verse": 20
      },
      {
        "text": "So Gehazi followed after Naaman. And when Naaman saw him running after him, he lighted down from the chariot to meet him, and said, Is all well?",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 53,
            "end": 56
          },
          {
            "start": 132,
            "end": 134
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 21,
        "crossReferences": [],
